<title>USA: Woolworth Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Woolworth Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.01     loss	 $0.17</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,000     loss	22,000</p>
<p> Sales		  1,768,000		1,820,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 134,100		  133,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Quarters ended Apr 26, 1997 and Apr 27, 1996</p>
<p>The Q1 1997 includes a charge of $2 million on discontinued operations and a gain of $4 million on the sale of real estate.</p>
<p>The Q1 1996 includes a charge of $19 million on discontinued operations.</p>
</text>
